BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Bike Repair 101
DTSTART:20260828T200000Z
DTEND:20260828T220000Z
DTSTAMP:20260825T060137Z
UID:8abf1eba-d7ab-5e25-8a19-22bede5fca2a
DESCRIPTION:Join our Basic Bike Maintenance Workshop at the Cycle Toronto 
 Rec Hub to learn hands-on skills including bike fit\, safety checks\, and 
 drive train care. This session provides access to all recommended tools an
 d staff guidance to help you keep your bike safe and road-ready. You'll le
 ave knowing how to perform routine maintenance yourself and clearly unders
 tand the basics of fixing your bike.\n\nDoors: 4 PM\n\nSession: 4:00-6:00 
 PM\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_repair_101_20260828
LOCATION:Evergreen Brickworks\n550 Bayview ave\n10\nToronto ON M4W 3X8\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/bike_repair_101_20260828
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coffee Outside Group Ride: East Don Trail
DTSTART:20260920T120000Z
DTEND:20260920T140000Z
DTSTAMP:20260825T060135Z
UID:b1a4d846-1168-59ce-b541-410af1dff571
DESCRIPTION:Join us for Coffee Outside\, a leisurely group ride along the 
 East Don River trail system. We'll roll at a chill pace\, take in the gree
 nery\, and stop for coffee and conversation at a scenic spot along the way
 . All bikes and all speeds are welcome. Just bring your mug\, your favouri
 te brew fixings\, and enjoy the morning.\n\nDoors: 8 AM\n\nSession: 8:00-1
 0 AM\n\nLight snacks provided\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/coffee_outside_
 group_ride_20260920
LOCATION:East Don Trail\n179 Bermondsey Rd\nToronto ON M4A 1X9\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/coffee_outside_group_ride_20260920
END:VEVENT
