BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Kidical Mass TO
DTSTART:20260829T124500Z
DTEND:20260829T141500Z
DTSTAMP:20260825T060135Z
UID:ff37ba61-66e4-5d3b-90ca-87f21890fdf2
DESCRIPTION:Cycle Toronto is proud to be powering the return of KidicalMas
 sTO on the last Saturday of every month until October.\n\nKidical Mass is 
 an international movement for child- and cycling-friendly cities. Kidical 
 Mass rides are an all-ages\, all-abilities celebration of cycling that hig
 hlights the need for healthier cities. Kids and their grown-ups ride their
  bikes together.\n\nWhen: Meet at 8:45 AM\, depart at 9 AM\nWhere: Biidaas
 ige Park - Old Fire Hall 30 (39 Commissioners Street)\nWhat: ~6 km family-
 friendly ride along multi-use paths\, quiet streets\, and dedicated cyclin
 g infrastructure\, supported by Cycle Toronto ride guides\n\nOur August Ki
 dical Mass TO Ride will start at the Old Fire Hall in Biidaasige Park. We'
 ll make our way up to Corktown Common and hop onto the newly improved Lowe
 r Don Trail. We'll end off at the Cycle Toronto Rec Hub at Evergreen Brick
  Works - just in time for snacks\, refreshments and the Farmer's Market!\n
 \nWe hope to see you there.\nURL: https://www.cycleto.ca/kidical_mass_2026
 0829
LOCATION:Old Fire Hall 30 - Biidaasige Park\n39 Commissioners St\nToronto 
 ON M5A 1A6\nCA
URL:https://www.cycleto.ca/kidical_mass_20260829
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
